MANUAL_ONLY=true
TITLE=E2E-97: Marketplace — purchase recorded and attached to the installation
TAGS=marketplace,billing,correctness
MODE=dynamo
BODY=With the Marketplace listing's Manage webhook pointed at the stage WebhookUrl (content type application/json, secret from SSM /mergewatch/{stage}/github-webhook-secret), send a marketplace_purchase.purchased from the listing's delivery log. Confirm one row at PK #MARKETPLACE with SK = lowercased login carrying accountId/planName/purchasedAt; then install the App and confirm the installation's #SETTINGS row gains marketplaceAccountLogin/Id/PlanName/AttachedAt and the #MARKETPLACE row gains attachedInstallationId. Redeliver the purchase and confirm still ONE row with purchasedAt unchanged. Finally send cancelled and confirm it sets cancelledAt, logs "recorded only, nothing revoked", and leaves the OSS grant, balance and freeReviewsUsed untouched.
